 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The particles -lah and -kah",
   "texto": [
    "**-lah** binds to a verbal form to soften an instruction or emphasize: **Jagalah lingkungan!** («Take care of the environment!»). **-kah** joins a word and marks or highlights a question: **Benarkah sungai itu tercemar?** («Is it true that the river is contaminated?»)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Conservation",
   "texto": [
    "**Pelestarian** is the conservation of something; **melestarikan** is the conservation of something. **Mendaur ulang** means recycling and **memilah** is to separate waste to treat them differently."
   ]
  },
